@startuml Filter Class by Academic Year
actor User
participant ": ClassManagementPage " as ClassManagementPage
participant ": ApiService " as ApiService
participant ": Router " as Router
participant ": ClassGroupController " as ClassGroupController
participant ": ClassGroupService " as ClassGroupService
participant ": ClassGroupRepository " as ClassGroupRepository
database Database

User->ClassManagementPage: 1. User selects Academic Year from dropdown
    activate User
activate ClassManagementPage
ClassManagementPage->ClassManagementPage: 2. Update selectedAcademicYearId state
ClassManagementPage->ClassManagementPage: 3. Trigger useEffect on academicYearId change
ClassManagementPage->ApiService: 4. Call dashboard(academicYearId, token)
deactivate ClassManagementPage
activate ApiService
ApiService->Router: 5. Send GET /api/classgroup/dashboard?academicYearId={id}
deactivate ApiService
activate Router
Router->ClassGroupController: 6. Route Request to Controller
deactivate Router
activate ClassGroupController
ClassGroupController->ClassGroupService: 7. Call GetDashboardDataAsync(academicYearId)
deactivate ClassGroupController
activate ClassGroupService
ClassGroupService->ClassGroupRepository: 8. Get Queryable Classes
activate ClassGroupRepository
ClassGroupRepository->Database: 9. Query ClassGroup with AcademicYearId filter
activate Database
Database-->ClassGroupRepository: 10. Return Filtered Class Records
deactivate Database
ClassGroupRepository->Database: 11. Query ClassGroupMembers for student count
activate Database
Database-->ClassGroupRepository: 12. Return Student Count Data
deactivate Database
ClassGroupRepository->Database: 13. Query AcademicYear for year name
activate Database
Database-->ClassGroupRepository: 14. Return AcademicYear Data
deactivate Database
ClassGroupRepository-->ClassGroupService: 15. Return ClassGroup Entities with Relations
deactivate ClassGroupRepository
ClassGroupService->ClassGroupService: 16. Calculate Statistics (TotalClasses, TotalStudents, TotalTeachers)
ClassGroupService->ClassGroupService: 17. Group Classes by Grade
ClassGroupService->ClassGroupService: 18. Map Entities to DTOs
ClassGroupService-->ClassGroupController: 19. Return ClassGroupDashboardDto
deactivate ClassGroupService
activate ClassGroupController
ClassGroupController->ClassGroupController: 20. Wrap in ResponseDto
ClassGroupController-->Router: 21. Send Success Response with Dashboard Data
activate Router
deactivate ClassGroupController
Router-->ApiService: 22. Return Response Data
activate ApiService
deactivate Router
ApiService->ApiService: 23. Extract data from response
ApiService-->ClassManagementPage: 24. Return Dashboard Data
activate ClassManagementPage
deactivate ApiService
ClassManagementPage->ClassManagementPage: 25. Update classes state with filtered data
ClassManagementPage->ClassManagementPage: 26. Update dashboardStats state
ClassManagementPage->ClassManagementPage: 27. Group classes by grade for display
ClassManagementPage->ClassManagementPage: 28. Re-render component with filtered classes
ClassManagementPage-->User: 29. Display Filtered Classes by Academic Year
deactivate ClassManagementPage
deactivate User

alt Error occurs
    ClassGroupService-->ClassGroupController: Error Response
    activate ClassGroupController
    deactivate ClassGroupService
    ClassGroupController-->Router: Send Error Response
    activate Router
    deactivate ClassGroupController
    Router-->ApiService: Return Error
    activate ApiService
    deactivate Router
    ApiService-->ClassManagementPage: Error Data
    activate ClassManagementPage
    deactivate ApiService
    ClassManagementPage->ClassManagementPage: Show Error Toast
    ClassManagementPage-->User: Display Error Message
    deactivate ClassManagementPage
    deactivate User
end
@enduml

